From db0f7e37f09b4b9513c8728adf34e2116dfae120 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Dev <dev@example.local>
Date: Thu, 5 Nov 2026 17:26:41 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] feat(history): add searchable history with method/status
 filters

Filter history entries by URL, method and status code with a debounced
search box. Supports method:POST and status:404 (or status:4xx) filters,
highlights matches, shows the result count and an empty state, and
remembers the search text in localStorage between panel openings.
